<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-649] Race condition in sync ZKUtils.createFullPathOptimistic()</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-649</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If multiple threads are calling createFullPathOptimistic() there will be race conditions on creating the intermediate nodes. If the intermediate nodes have been created since we last check, we can just ignore the exception and continue creating the child nodes.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
